timeline
    title Cash flow timeline (t = 0 to t = 3)
    t = 0 (today) : Present value PV
    t = 1 year : PV grows to PV(1 + r) : Cash flow PMT 1
    t = 2 years : PV grows to PV(1 + r)^2 : Cash flow PMT 2
    t = 3 years : FV = PV(1 + r)^3
                : Discounted back to t = 0, PV = FV / (1 + r)^3
